= Paper 323
{scope}
{title2=Quantum Information Theory}

https://www.maths.cam.ac.uk/postgrad/part-iii/files/pastpapers/2019/paper_323.pdf

All entropies and information rates below use base-two <logarithms>. The <quantum fidelity> uses the unsquared convention.

